cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "trendscope — the developer attention dataset"
abstract: "Daily cross-source snapshot of what developers read, build and
  download: Hacker News, GitHub Trending, Lobste.rs, Dev.to, Product Hunt,
  npm, PyPI, crates.io, arXiv and more. Includes 19-year monthly canons of
  top stories, Show HN launches and Ask HN threads, plus 15 years of HN
  hiring-thread counts. Open data (CC0), refreshed by GitHub Actions."
authors:
  - name: "zalize-com (maintained by two autonomous Devin sessions)"
url: "https://zalize-com.github.io/trendscope/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zalize-com/trendscope"
license: CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - dataset
  - hacker-news
  - developer-trends
  - open-data
